1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,500
Your Honor, I object to this entire line of questioning.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,000
The witness clearly has no knowledge of the events of that night.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Ben Matlock will prove that my client is innocent of all charges.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Ladies and gentlemen of the jury, please consider the evidence carefully.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
The prosecution cannot place my client anywhere near the warehouse.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Detective, isn't it true that you never checked the security tapes?

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,000
I have practiced law in this county for over thirty years.

8
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
And in all that time I have never seen a case this poorly investigated.

9
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,000
The fingerprints on the weapon do not belong to the defendant.

10
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Someone deliberately planted that evidence to frame an honest man.

11
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:55,000
When I am finished, the real killer will be sitting in that chair.

12
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Now tell the court exactly what you saw on the evening of the fourth.

13
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,000
You testified earlier that the room was completely dark.

14
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:10,000
So how could you possibly identify the face of the intruder?

15
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:15,000
I submit that your entire testimony is nothing but speculation.

16
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,000
The truth, ladies and gentlemen, is far simpler than the district attorney claims.

17
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:25,000
My client was at home with his family the whole evening.

18
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:30,000
There is not a shred of physical evidence connecting him to this crime.

19
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:35,000
I ask you to return the only verdict that justice allows.

20
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Find this innocent man not guilty and let him go home.
